  "id": 203987409415016,
  "uuid": "bbf739bf-cca7-46a7-b598-131f35382a3c",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "ab063709-ccd5-5f24-ae71-b6d9ed6ab246",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "608b9e1d-d8cf-887a-587c-be96801b77be",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Jane's journey into the world of medicine began in her primary school days. Initially aspiring to become a doctor, she was steered towards nursing due to academic constraints. However, her passion for helping others remained unwavering. A personal experience with her brother, who was diagnosed with meningitis and autism, ignited a deep desire to understand and address the challenges faced by those in need.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Jane's dedication to her profession has not gone unnoticed. In 2021, she was honoured with the Best Nurse Badge from the Beyond Zero Health Awards, a recognition that celebrated her exceptional contributions and commitment to her field. Her decision to pursue a degree at AKU was influenced by the university's renowned reputation and state-of-the-art facilities. Inspired by a former teacher's encouragement, Jane was drawn to AKU's advanced Virtual Learning Environment and innovative teaching methods.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Looking ahead, Jane's career aspirations are as ambitious as they are community focused. She aspires to become a researcher and eventually a professor, with a particular interest in addressing significant health challenges in her community. Jane is driven to understand the causes of diseases such as leishmaniasis and trachoma and develop effective management strategies.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Jane's story is a testament to the power of passion, perseverance, and purpose. Her unwavering commitment to healthcare, coupled with her desire to make a lasting impact, positions her as a beacon of hope for her community and a role model for aspiring healthcare professionals.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
