    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Amidst the vast expanse of Kajiado, Jane Naisol's commitment to healthcare is a steadfast oasis of compassion. As a Bachelor of Science in Nursing student at the Aga Khan University in Kenya, and a dedicated nurse at Ngong Sub-County Hospital, Jane embodies the spirit of deep care, resilience, and a lifelong pursuit of making a difference in the grassroots of Kenya.",
